CTUAL r13 TERMINAL LOG prints nativeBChainPass/fixtureSignedJwtOnly/noRealConsent/originalVolumeTouched. No real Keycloak/customer DB used; fixture only.\",\n      \"assessment\": \"supported\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"claim\": \"The full supplied native fault tests and actual readback show corrupt Attempt/conflict/config/manifest/auth negatives, actual COMMIT with lost-return recovered without re-entering write, forged and malformed real child output refused by native history, preserved historical consumption after revocation and exact owned fixture teardown, without original database or credential effects.\",\n      \"evidence\": \"native_service_fault_matrix in test_budget_policy_renewal_service.py writes corrupt Attempt JSON then restores, expects unresolved; mutates expected_source_hash expects conflict; disables config expects RenewalConnectionBlocked; alters table COMMENT expects RenewalConnectionBlocked; supplies wrong password expects OperationalError; injects RenewalStoreUnknown after native COMMIT via commit_then_drop_return expects recovered observed with same requestHash and only one marker left. native_forged_stdout_assertions patches subprocess.Popen to return fake observe_process frames: single matching output returns unresolved, duplicate frames returns unknown, both verify receipt count and markers unchanged. native_readonly_process_assertions verifies consume historical readback returns observed with same requestHash and activationEligible=False, receipt count unchanged. test_budget_policy_renewal_connection.py rejects missing private config, broad permissions, symlinks, ancestor symlinks, duplicate JSON keys, relative paths, closed config, identity/source/caller/database/passfile drift. native-b-final-readback-r4.json records extraLostAckProposalOnlyPrepared true, originalVolumeTouched false. ACTUAL"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"agnes","model":"agnes-2.5-flash","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,